      <title>DynamoDB原生AI搜索，向量数据库的生存空间还剩多少</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260823/DynamoDB%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9FAI%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E5%AD%98%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%98%E5%89%A9%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91/</link>
